<item>
            <title>[LU-20566] FLR-EC: recover data from parity code for DIO+AIO</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20566</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The patch &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/62757&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/62757&lt;/a&gt; (&quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-12669&quot; title=&quot;FLR-EC: recover data from parity code&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-12669&quot;&gt;LU-12669&lt;/a&gt; ec: recover data from parity&quot;) does not handle AIO+DIO or io_uring async read reconstruction.  This would need to be handled before the 2.18.0 release.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
